  "structure": {
    "block_count": 101,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Best Fish for Toddlers and Kids",
        "text_sha256": "de10f9952abed7a86c0d2fab4cd8571d9dbd50200d2944e44fb820fe670b9795",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "fish for toddlers",
        "text_sha256": "861956f993cb3a1c11c489fd56189b956f943cbe74b73d443cec5146152833c2",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Healthy fish is a deliciously lean source of protein that'll have your toddler hooked!",
        "text_sha256": "197c2b105e221bba5b194a0725635b0a46c27f849707aff70d8524419eca854a",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "One fish, two fish, red fish — whose fish? Your toddler’s, that’s who! Fish can be just as entertaining on the plate as they are in the pages of a Dr. Seuss book (and no, you don’t always have to resort to fish sticks).",
        "text_sha256": "dc4b1626ab3fa763e831aae82ce9e692d5224e19c08538866199ece3f6b350c2",
        "word_count": 44
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you’re constantly casting about for something to serve your toddler that will expand her food preferences beyond mac-and-cheese, spaghetti and grilled cheese, try doing a little fishing at your supermarket fish counter.",
        "text_sha256": "b89b8033e958ebe8703be89c20285ddf15af8800a52d4b80e31d1e77d6a49370",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "There’s good reason to add healthy fish to your toddler’s plate. Fish is low in saturated fat and high in protein, vitamin D and many of the B vitamins.",
        "text_sha256": "3847e8dedfdacb2600b9c892c98d9a18dd8ff1ded4c18b9171fe34c050aa281a",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What’s more, fatty fish (like salmon and mackerel) is chockfull of omega-3 essential fatty acids, which are important for your child’s brain, nervous system and vision. Plus, adding fish to her diet at an early age might help protect against asthma and eczema.",
        "text_sha256": "4efff4d4cef4533a379cb9cdc759a3a1da19b5844f7b8931ecc3cfa61fc91c3b",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But even with the amazing benefits of fish, it’s important to fish wisely. Contaminants, like mercury and PCBs (polychlorinated biphenyls), which can affect the brain and may cause learning and behavior problems, lurk in many fish and shellfish. Some species contain very high levels; others have only trace amounts.",
        "text_sha256": "4dddf6ab0a38eb7f02549da4688e029d15b70fa6720be13d322e7fc7d9032114",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What are the best types of fish for toddlers and kids?",
        "text_sha256": "ec316d0fbaeff4189bbd4c3d191a77886740cc49af4554a2bce188262ec062b9",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "According to the Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), the “best” types of fish include:",
        "text_sha256": "78844437b26dd3916426a874733e3a136ca4f8788125412eeb9f1480aafaade9",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
